### Error Handling and Edge Cases - Comprehensive Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json
@testUserId = error-test-user

### 1. Invalid HTTP Method on Application Endpoint
# @name invalidMethodApplications
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "invalid": "method"
}

###

### 2. Invalid Content-Type for JSON Endpoint
# @name invalidContentType
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: text/plain

This should be JSON but sent as plain text

###

### 3. Malformed JSON Request
# @name malformedJson
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "user_id": "{{testUserId}}",
    "application_type": "internship",
    "status": "brouillon",
    "type": "Internship",
    "data": {
        "company": "Malformed JSON Corp",
        "position": "Test Position",
        "duration_months": 6,
        "start_date": "2025-09-01"
    
    // Missing closing brace and invalid comment
    }
}
###

### 4. Empty JSON Request
# @name emptyJsonRequest
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{}

###

### 5. Null JSON Request
# @name nullJsonRequest
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

null

###

### 6. Array Instead of Object
# @name arrayInsteadOfObject
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

[
    {
        "user_id": "{{testUserId}}",
        "application_type": "internship"
    }
]

###

### 7. Missing Required Fields
# @name missingRequiredFields
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "user_id": "{{testUserId}}"
}

###

### 8. Invalid Application Type
# @name invalidApplicationType
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "user_id": "{{testUserId}}",
    "application_type": "invalid_type",
    "status": "brouillon",
    "type": "InvalidType",
    "data": {
        "some": "data"
    }
}

###

### 9. Invalid Status Value
# @name invalidStatusValue
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "user_id": "{{testUserId}}",
    "application_type": "internship",
    "status": "invalid_status",
    "type": "Internship",
    "data": {
        "company": "Invalid Status Corp",
        "position": "Test Position",
        "duration_months": 6,
        "start_date": "2025-09-01"
    }
}

###

### 10. Type Mismatch Between application_type and type
# @name typeMismatch
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "user_id": "{{testUserId}}",
    "application_type": "internship",
    "status": "brouillon",
    "type": "Incubation",
    "data": {
        "company": "Type Mismatch Corp",
        "position": "Test Position",
        "duration_months": 6,
        "start_date": "2025-09-01"
    }
}

###

### 11. Wrong Data Structure for Application Type
# @name wrongDataStructure
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "user_id": "{{testUserId}}",
    "application_type": "internship",
    "status": "brouillon",
    "type": "Internship",
    "data": {
        "project_name": "This is incubation data",
        "business_model": "But sent with internship type",
        "target_market": "Should fail validation",
        "team_size": 5,
        "project_stage": "Wrong"
    }
}

###

### 12. Extremely Large JSON Payload
# @name extremelyLargePayload
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "user_id": "{{testUserId}}",
    "application_type": "internship",
    "status": "brouillon",
    "type": "Internship",
    "data": {
        "company": "Large Payload Corp",
        "position": "Test Position",
        "duration_months": 6,
        "start_date": "2025-09-01",
        "description": "This is an extremely long description that contains thousands of characters to test payload size limits and server handling of large requests. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat. Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum. Sed ut perspiciatis unde omnis iste natus error sit voluptatem accusantium doloremque laudantium, totam rem aperiam, eaque ipsa quae ab illo inventore veritatis et quasi architecto beatae vitae dicta sunt explicabo. Nemo enim ipsam voluptatem quia voluptas sit aspernatur aut odit aut fugit, sed quia consequuntur magni dolores eos qui ratione voluptatem sequi nesciunt. [This would continue for many more repetitions to test size limits]"
    }
}

