### 28. Invalid Accept Header
# @name invalidAcceptHeader
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Accept: invalid/content-type

###

### 29. Missing Accept Header
# @name missingAcceptHeader
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications

###

### 30. Invalid HTTP Version
# This test might not work with all HTTP clients
# @name invalidHttpVersion
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications HTTP/0.9
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 31. Request with Invalid Authorization Header
# @name invalidAuthHeader
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Authorization: Invalid auth format
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 32. Very Long URL Parameters
# @name veryLongUrlParams
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications?user_id=very_long_user_id_that_exceeds_normal_limits_and_tests_the_maximum_allowed_length_for_url_parameters_in_the_query_string&application_type=very_long_application_type_name&status=very_long_status_name&page=1&limit=10&extra_param1=value1&extra_param2=value2&extra_param3=value3&extra_param4=value4&extra_param5=value5
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 33. Invalid Characters in URL
# @name invalidUrlCharacters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications?user_id=user<>|&application_type=type"&status=status'
Accept: {{contentType}}

